{'symbol': 'O', 'date': '2022-12-13 16:05:00', 'title': '118TH COMMON STOCK MONTHLY DIVIDEND INCREASE DECLARED BY REALTY INCOME', 'text': "SAN DIEGO , DEC. 13, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- REALTY INCOME CORPORATION (REALTY INCOME, NYSE: O), THE MONTHLY DIVIDEND COMPANY®, TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED AN INCREASE IN THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK MONTHLY CASH DIVIDEND TO $0.2485 PER SHARE FROM $0.248 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON JANUARY 13, 2023, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF JANUARY 3, 2023."}